    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "After the railroad was built close by, a plan for the town site was created in 1888, setting the stage for Liberal’s growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liberal%2C_Kansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1920, natural gas was discovered west of Liberal, becoming part of the massive Panhandle‑Hugoton Gas Field.",
